---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Grievance Redressal & Legal Disclosures | SatvaStones Jewellery"
  description="Mandatory statutory disclosures under Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules 2020 and DPDP Act 2023. Grievance Officer: Anirudh A Verma, Vapi, Gujarat."
>
  <!-- Minimalist Legal Header -->
  <div class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-2">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-[#a1505a]">
        <span>Rule 5(1) &amp; Rule 6, Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Grievance Redressal &amp; Disclosures</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Official statutory disclosures for <strong>SatvaStones Jewellery</strong> • Operated as an Indian Sole Proprietorship under the registered name of <strong>Anirudh A Verma</strong>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400">
        Statutory SLA: Acknowledged within 48 Hours | Redressed within 1 Month
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 bg-white p-6 sm:p-12 border border-gray-200 rounded-[26px] shadow-xs text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

      <!-- Statutory Entity Profile Card -->
      <section class="space-y-4 bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#f2707f]"></span>
          <span>1. Mandatory Business Disclosures (Rule 4 &amp; 5)</span>
        </h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Brand / Trading Name</span>
            <span class="font-extrabold text-gray-900 text-sm block">SatvaStones Fine Jewellery</span>
            <span class="text-gray-500 text-[11px]">Online fine anti-tarnish everyday jewellery store</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Registered Legal Entity Name</span>
            <span class="font-extrabold text-gray-900 text-sm block">Anirudh A Verma (Sole Proprietorship)</span>
            <span class="text-gray-500 text-[11px]">Registered under Indian Proprietorship Laws</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">GSTIN (Goods &amp; Services Tax)</span>
            <span class="font-extrabold text-gray-900 font-mono text-sm block">24DDAPV4074H1ZF</span>
            <span class="text-gray-500 text-[11px]">State of Gujarat, India (Tax Assessment Zone: Vapi)</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Business Type &amp; Inventory Model</span>
            <span class="font-extrabold text-gray-900 text-sm block">Inventory-Based Single-Brand Store</span>
            <span class="text-gray-500 text-[11px]">100% owned &amp; dispatched from our Vapi atelier</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 space-y-1 sm:col-span-2">
            <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Registered Physical Address &amp; Atelier Hub</span>
            <span class="font-extrabold text-gray-900 text-sm block">Chala, Vapi, Gujarat - 396191, India</span>
            <span class="text-gray-500 text-[11px]">Primary headquarters, quality inspection center, and dispatch facility</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Grievance Officer Formal Designation -->
      <section class="space-y-4 bg-rose-50/40 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#f2707f]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m0-10.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.75c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.57-.598-3.75h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.249-8.25-3.286zm0 13.036h.008v.008H12v-.008z" />
          </svg>
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">
            2. Designated Statutory Grievance Officer
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Pursuant to <strong>Rule 5(1)(l) of the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020</strong>, <strong>Rule 5(9) of the IT SPDI Rules, 2011</strong>, and <strong>Section 13 of the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023</strong>, the details of our Grievance Officer are set forth below:
        </p>

        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-rose-200 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div>
              <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Name of Officer</span>
              <strong class="text-gray-900 text-sm">Anirudh A Verma</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Official Designation</span>
              <strong class="text-gray-900 text-sm">Grievance Officer &amp; Proprietor</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Official Grievance Email</span>
              <a href="mailto:grievance@satvastones.in" class="text-[#f2707f] font-bold underline text-sm">grievance@satvastones.in</a>
              <span class="text-gray-500 text-[11px] block">(CC: support@satvastones.in)</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Direct Telephone / Helpline</span>
              <strong class="text-gray-900 text-sm"><a href="tel:+919016703180" class="hover:text-[#f2707f]">+91 90167 03180</a></strong>
              <span class="text-gray-500 text-[11px] block">Mon–Sat (10:00 AM – 7:00 PM IST)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sm:col-span-2">
              <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Physical Service of Notices</span>
              <span class="text-gray-800 text-xs">Chala, Vapi, Gujarat - 396191, India</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Statutory SLA Highlight Banner -->
        <div class="bg-rose-100/60 p-4 rounded-xl border border-rose-300 text-xs text-rose-950 space-y-1">
          <p class="font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>Mandatory Statutory SLA (Service Level Agreement):</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            • <strong>Acknowledgement:</strong> Every grievance or complaint received will be assigned a unique ticket reference and acknowledged within <strong>48 hours</strong>.<br />
            • <strong>Redressal:</strong> The grievance shall be fully investigated and redressed within <strong>one month (30 days)</strong> from the date of its receipt.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Step-by-Step Grievance Filing Process -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">
          3. How to Submit a Formal Grievance
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have encountered any issue concerning order delivery, product quality, transit damage, or personal data rights:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-xs text-gray-700 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Step 1 (First Contact):</strong> Email our customer support concierge at <a href="mailto:support@satvastones.in" class="text-[#f2707f] font-bold underline">support@satvastones.in</a> or message us on WhatsApp with your Order ID and concern. Over 95% of issues are resolved within 24 hours.</li>
          <li><strong>Step 2 (Escalation to Grievance Officer):</strong> If your ticket is not satisfactorily addressed within 48 hours, email <a href="mailto:grievance@satvastones.in" class="text-[#f2707f] font-bold underline">grievance@satvastones.in</a> quoting your original ticket number.</li>
          <li><strong>Step 3 (Statutory Redressal):</strong> The Grievance Officer will personally review your file, inspect packaging and dispatch logs from our Vapi hub, and provide a formal written resolution within 30 days.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- External Statutory Escalation Paths -->
      <section class="space-y-3 bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">
          4. External Consumer &amp; Regulatory Recourse
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you remain dissatisfied with the resolution provided by our Grievance Officer, you have the statutory right under Indian law to approach government authorities:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1 text-xs">
          <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 space-y-1">
            <strong class="text-gray-900 block">National Consumer Helpline (NCH)</strong>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-[11px]">Toll-Free Helpline: <strong>1915</strong> or <strong>1800-11-4000</strong></p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-[11px]">Portal: <a href="https://consumerhelpline.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#a1505a] underline">consumerhelpline.gov.in</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 space-y-1">
            <strong class="text-gray-900 block">Data Protection Board of India (DPBI)</strong>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-[11px]">For personal data breaches or denial of DPDP rights under the DPDP Act, 2023.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-[11px]">Official Portal: <span class="font-mono text-gray-700">dpbi.gov.in</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
